  "notes": "Scoped T4 analytic/exact reduction plus executed adversarial diagnostics. A13-CLASSII-STOPPED-CURRENT-FAR-COMPLETE-CURRENT-NEAR-COORDINATE-REDUCTION (R-082) sharpens the R-081 frontier. The complete FAR wedge is one exact deterministic stopped-current square; predictable drift is load-bearing and raw value innovation centers only with its heat compensator. The uncontrolled production FAR subbranch closes cutoff-uniformly through the support-refined R-050 C^(3 alpha-1) remainder. The orthogonal causal Carleson route is sharp at s=1/2 but still needs a balanced production decomposition. The complete current has a global four-row Pauli--Fierz coordinate with B=C^T C and one rational Lipschitz row. Independent two-root and symmetric-heat regressions prevent rootwise compression and square-after-heat overclaims; general future covariance defects remain signed. Primary 54/54 and non-importing independent 52/52 pass; integrated and aggregate counts are manifest-pinned. The final twelve-page PDF has zero overfull boxes, no forms, and final-render visual QA. T-050 remains in progress at controlled CFAR, complete heat-lifted signed NEAR, overlap-stable progression, controlled-shell one-use, and Nelson synthesis. Sector A remains open. Tier stays T4."
